  "output": {
    "answer": "That read is 45 of 69 non-locked lots, 65.2%, with a 95% Wilson interval of 53.4 to 75.4%. Those 69 sit inside a larger set of 87 truth lots I tapped myself over five UTC days, mostly English. No one else verified the calls — it's a single tapper, me, and the record flags that as a caveat: sellers and card mix vary a lot day to day, and there's a selection bias risk since I may have tapped more when a pick was clearly right or clearly wrong than when it was ambiguous.",
